      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCOTCH ROCKET (4) goes very well this course and distance starting 24 times for eight wins and eight minors. Comes off a (29.88) win last time, scoring by half a length in a OPEN over 510m at this track. Expected to go close. CANYA GOLD (7) was impressive last time, posting a strong 29.91 when second behind SCOTCH ROCKET and clocking a new PB this course and distance. Will be in this for a long way. STAND NEAR (2) had been racing well prior to her last start fourth at this track following a Grade 5/6 win three back with a third placing. Good beginner and aided by a handy draw. Can feature with the right run. BIT FANCY NANCY (5) is in fine form and looks a good top-three chance again.",
